{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1353","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. K-periodic Garland"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given a garland consisting of $$$n$$$ lamps. States of the lamps are represented by the string $$$s$$$ of length $$$n$$$. The $$$i$$$-th character of the string $$$s_i$$$ equals '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' if the $$$i$$$-th lamp is turned off or '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' if the $$$i$$$-th lamp is turned on. You are also given a positive integer $$$k$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In one move, you can choose "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"one lamp"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" and change its state (i.e. turn it on if it is turned off and vice versa)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The garland is called $$$k$$$-periodic if the distance between "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"each pair of adjacent turned on lamps"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"exactly"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$k$$$. Consider the case $$$k=3$$$. Then garlands \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"00010010"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1001001"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"00010"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" are good but garlands \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"00101001"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1000001"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"01001100"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" are not. Note that "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"the garland is not cyclic"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", i.e. the first turned on lamp is not going after the last turned on lamp and vice versa."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your task is to find the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"minimum"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" number of moves you need to make to obtain $$$k$$$-periodic garland from the given one."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You have to answer $$$t$$$ independent test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains one integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 25~ 000$$$) — the number of test cases. Then $$$t$$$ test cases follow."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the test case contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$k$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 10^6; 1 \\le k \\le n$$$) — the length of $$$s$$$ and the required period. The second line of the test case contains the string $$$s$$$ consisting of $$$n$$$ characters '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' and '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"'."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$10^6$$$ ($$$\\sum n \\le 10^6$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, print the answer — the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"minimum"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" number of moves you need to make to obtain $$$k$$$-periodic garland from the given one."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n6\n9 2\n010001010\n9 3\n111100000\n7 4\n1111111\n10 3\n1001110101\n1 1\n1\n1 1\n0\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1\n2\n5\n4\n0\n0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"E","problemCode":"1353E","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1353/problem/E"}